-- refusal
type: Neemle.OrmLite.CapabilityNotSupportedException
message: provider 'no-capability' does not support JsonDocument, which filter on a key inside a JSON document requires (table 'corpus_notes'). no-capability has no JSON document type, so it cannot filter on a key inside a JSON document; a statement emitted anyway would carry PostgreSQL syntax to a server that cannot parse it.
